    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/bfe564b6b18c7d48e2d452b24461c0d2.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>During missions the UDC will ask Hayden Blaze to help in large scale battles across the universe to help bring peace and security to all planets who need it.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/405f202da1968d205351e48c026e5947.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>Pilot your spaceship in space combat missions and customise it with cosmetics to your liking.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/56938e47939e4e946dc3e64cee017892.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>Customise your pistol you stole from a zenith command ship to increase its lethality and make it look better then ever.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/eb6b7ccf6583616c1a49eea61ba60447.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>Fighting for the UDC can be hard so take a break by practising your skills in space or ground combat with never ending waves of hostiles marching towards you.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/fe39ba2118b83debd063cdaffec0e515.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Massive single-player campaign<br></li><li> Customisable weapon and space ship<br></li><li> Wave based minigame<br></li><li> Free post launch updates</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/bfe564b6b18c7d48e2d452b24461c0d2.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>During missions the UDC will ask Hayden Blaze to help in large scale battles across the universe to help bring peace and security to all planets who need it.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/405f202da1968d205351e48c026e5947.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>Pilot your spaceship in space combat missions and customise it with cosmetics to your liking.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/56938e47939e4e946dc3e64cee017892.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>Customise your pistol you stole from a zenith command ship to increase its lethality and make it look better then ever.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/eb6b7ccf6583616c1a49eea61ba60447.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><i>Fighting for the UDC can be hard so take a break by practising your skills in space or ground combat with never ending waves of hostiles marching towards you.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950760/extras/fe39ba2118b83debd063cdaffec0e515.webp?t=1750097170\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Massive single-player campaign<br></li><li> Customisable weapon and space ship<br></li><li> Wave based minigame<br></li><li> Free post launch updates</li></ul>",
